Aim: Demonstrate byte stream input and output.

Algorithm: Start
write bytes to file using FileOutputStream
read using FileInputStream
display
stop.

Program:

import java.io.*;
class StreamDemo {
    public static void main(String[] args) throws IOException {
        try(FileOutputStream out=new FileOutputStream("data.txt")){
            out.write("Java IO".getBytes());
        }
        try(FileInputStream in=new FileInputStream("data.txt")){
            int b;
            while((b=in.read())!=-1) System.out.print((char)b);
        }
    }
}

